      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640211,
      "VoiceCondition": "GunFire",
      "ChatBubbleType": "None",
      "VoiceClip": 3164174054,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "다음 탄, 장전 부탁드려요!",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "次弾装填、お願いします！",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0379"
    },
    {
      "EventContentId": 864,
      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640212,
      "VoiceCondition": "Combo",
      "ChatBubbleType": "Normal",
      "VoiceClip": 72146661,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "연속 기록이에요, 선생님!",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "先生！連続記録更新ですよ！",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0379"
    },
    {
      "EventContentId": 864,
      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640213,
      "VoiceCondition": "Combo",
      "ChatBubbleType": "Normal",
      "VoiceClip": 855084229,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "다음 표적, 준비하겠습니다!",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "次の標的を狙います！",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0379"
    },
    {
      "EventContentId": 864,
      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640214,
      "VoiceCondition": "Combo",
      "ChatBubbleType": "Normal",
      "VoiceClip": 4020077001,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "지금까지 노력한 보람이 있네요!",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "これまで頑張ってきた成果ですね！",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0379"
    },
    {
      "EventContentId": 864,
      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640215,
      "VoiceCondition": "CharacterSelect",
      "ChatBubbleType": "None",
      "VoiceClip": 473970189,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "내가 도움이 된다면, 얼마든지 좋아.",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "私でよければ、いくらでも手伝う。",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0380"
    },
    {
      "EventContentId": 864,
      "CharacterGroupId": 2,
      "UniqueId": 8640216,
      "VoiceCondition": "CharacterSelect",
      "ChatBubbleType": "None",
      "VoiceClip": 1539471049,
      "SubtitleLocalizeKR": "준비됐어. 언제나 말이야.",
      "SubtitleLocalizeJP": "準備完了。いつでもいける。",
      "SubtitlePortrait": "TankRacing_Portrait_Normal_CH0380"
